    "description": "欧洲最大、最雄伟的歌剧院之一。新古典主义建筑和新艺术风格内饰营造出非凡的氛围。",
    "fullDescription": "马西莫剧院是欧洲最大的歌剧院之一，以其出色的音响效果和超过1300个座位而闻名。每年举办超过130场音乐、歌剧和舞蹈演出。外观为新古典主义风格，融合了西西里希腊神庙的元素，内部为新艺术风格。",
    "images": ["https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757842913/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/pexels-giota-sakellariou-2323975-4089286.jpg","https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757843017/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/pexels-inmaculada-pena-567266-12615316.jpg","https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757842785/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/palermo-473692_1280.jpg"],
