    "title": "巴拉罗市场",
    "description": "一个色彩缤纷、香气四溢、充满正宗风味的历史市场。品味西西里美食真谛、融入巴勒莫日常生活的绝佳之地。",
    "fullDescription": "巴拉罗市场是巴勒莫最古老、最热闹的历史市场之一，是西西里日常生活的真实舞台。市场街道上交织着东方香料的气息、当地蔬果的鲜艳色彩和小贩的叫卖声。品尝巴勒莫街头美食的理想之地：炸饭团、豌豆饼、炸土豆饼等当地特色美食。",
    "images": ["https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757845139/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/pexels-adria-masi-461420600-20526951.jpg","https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757844825/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/pexels-davide-machi-142956228-10368236.jpg","https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757845200/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/pexels-efrem-efre-2786187-19224336.jpg","https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757845290/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/pexels-efrem-efre-2786187-23025304.jpg","https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757952040/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/a5b8f49a-c685-4fe9-a0be-48884ebb82d9.jpg"],
    "lat": 38.11189, "lng": 13.35456, "reverse": false
  },
  {
    "title": "植物园",
    "description": "巴勒莫市中心的绿色绿洲，是在异域植物和百年古树中放松休憩的理想之地。",
    "fullDescription": "巴勒莫植物园建于1789年，是欧洲最重要的植物园之一。园区面积约10公顷，收藏了来自世界各地的12000余种植物。漫步其中，可欣赏热带植物、多肉植物、参天古树和珍稀物种温室。远离城市喧嚣、沉浸于宁静自然美景的完美场所。",
    "images": ["https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757844192/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/joshua-kettle-jMWE5NyjIYY-unsplash.jpg","https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757955725/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/IMG-20250915-WA0015.jpg","https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757955765/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/IMG-20250915-WA0014.jpg","https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxysr1a6/image/upload/v1757955833/THALEA-PALERMO-APARTMENT/IMG-20250915-WA0013.jpg"],
